From 6aa2929d82d67c173681ed2f8ab9af5a97c6b28e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:44:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Proposal capture, customer proposal, and the surf design
 system
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Deep Seas
  "Configuration" renamed, with a drawn sounding-weight icon.

Zoho findings
  Lead_Status on the LEADS module already carries the right vocabulary —
  Not Contacted/New, Met, Converted to Project. But Leads is a separate
  cold list (~hundreds, all owner West, none converted) with no overlap
  with the ~200 Contacts the audit actually runs on, and Contacts and
  Solar_Projects have no stage field at all. So the same option names
  are mirrored onto a new Sales_Stage field on Solar_Projects, which is
  the record that holds the proposal. Identical wording means the two
  pipelines report together without translation.

Proposal storage is split on purpose
  Supabase client_data.proposal holds the FULL object — every input,
  including ones nobody will report on — so a rep can reopen the tool
  and see the screen the customer saw. Zoho gets a ~15-value summary,
  six of which already have fields. Putting all of it in Zoho would
  mean ~20 custom fields, most written and never queried, each a
  migration when pricing changes.

  Supabase is written first. If Zoho fails the record still stands and
  the response says so — a stage that lies is worse than one that lags.
  Fields Zoho does not know about are retried away one at a time and
  named back to the rep, rather than failing the whole save.

Customer proposal
  Built for a homeowner reading it three days later, possibly to a
  spouse who was never at the appointment: what does it cost a month,
  what does it do for me, what now. One enormous number, warm light
  used once, faceted surfaces — not a grid of equal-weight cards.

  Nothing rep-facing renders. proposal.internal carries commission and
  floor and this component never reads it; verified by asserting the
  commission figure, the words commission/floor, and the APR are all
  absent from the rendered output.

Surf design system
  src/surf/theme.js encodes what the reference artwork is doing: the
  gradient runs cold to warm left to right, the light is small and far
  away, surfaces are faceted rather than flat. Ten original icons on
  lucide's 24-grid and stroke conventions — Deep Seas, Treasure, Swell,
  Quiver, Beach, Tide, Barrel, Heading, Buoy, Shell.

